mathjax-fonts/

# LLM-tools kit: the 4 docs below are copied from the repo root by build.rs
# (generated duplicates). AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / demo-starter.html stay committed.
# LLM-tools kit — build.rs assembles these at build time from canonical sources:
# reference/ from the 3 AUTHORING docs only (docs/LLM-EDITING.md,
# docs/DEMO_AUTHORING.md, docs/DEMO_SPEC.md — NOT the internal docs), and skills/
# from docs/skills/. Both are generated duplicates. Canonical skills live in
# docs/skills/ (committed, versioned with the app); skills-public/ is the standalone
# published mirror. AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / demo-starter.html in the kit are committed.
src-tauri/resources/llm-tools/reference/
src-tauri/resources/llm-tools/skills/

# Python bytecode cache (tools/)
__pycache__/

# Debug-menu batch artifacts (per-run output dirs + JSON reports)
_debug-export/
_debug-roundtrip/
debug-report-*.json

# SVG test-deck builder artifacts (regeneratable via
# tools/build_svg_test_deck.py)
_svg-fixtures/
test-presentations/svg-render-test.eigendeck

# Notebook spike build artifacts — see public/notebook-spike/README.md
# and FINDINGS.md. Rebuild via spike-tools/setup.sh.
public/notebook-spike/lite/
spike-tools/.venv/
spike-tools/lite-build/
spike-tools/jupyter.log
spike-tools/nohup.out

# Vitest coverage reports
coverage/

# Agent memory mirror (per-machine cross-project memory) + runtime lock — never repo content
.claude/memory/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Public skills repo — its OWN standalone git repo (distributable set of Eigendeck
# skills for Claude / Claude Code). Lives here for convenience but is published
# separately; never part of the app repo. See skills-public/README.md.
skills-public/
public/fonts/**/*.woff2
